>>
Rule 1 (size of the matrix must be a positive integer)
{v_1 : int} |= v_1 ≥ 1
>>
Rule 3 (matrix size must allow at least one contrast vector when full is false)
{v_1 : int, v_2 : bool} |= if v_2 = false then v_1 ≥ 2 else v_1 ≥ 1
>>
Rule 5 (size of the matrix must be at least 2 to define contrasts)
{v_1 : int} |= v_1 ≥ 2
>>
Rule 6 (when matrix size is 1, full must be true to avoid returning an empty matrix)
{v_1 : int, v_2 : bool} |= if v_1 = 1 then v_2 = true
>>
Rule 7 (size of the matrix must not be zero)
{v_1 : int} |= v_1 ≠ 0
